<title>BELGIUM: EU sets periodic refunds for sugar.</title>
<headline>EU sets periodic refunds for sugar.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set periodic refunds for white and raw sugar, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The refund for whites was set at 41 Ecus per 100 kg and for raw sugar in its natural state at 36.17 Ecus per 100 kg, the official said.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6800 REUTER</p>
</text>
